  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Armenia: Building sustainable apparel and agribusiness value chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Th project will create a more conducive business environment in agribusiness and apparel sectors in Armenia, contributing to better livelihoods and decent employment. The activities will be directed at making SMEs more competitive, more digital and more sustainable. BSOs will be supported in provision a more relevant and update support to SMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
